  "individual_generation_prompts": {
    "hero-margherita.webp": "Top-down close overhead photo of single round Neapolitan Margherita pizza with visible charring and melted creamy mozzarella, tomato sauce, basil leaves arranged across toppings, on round warm brown wooden board. Beige matte tabletop with scattered bright green basil leaves and small red tomatoes, shallow soft contact shadow; warm diffuse studio light from upper left. Crop 412:445, pizza board centered, food fills 85% width, no text, UI, badges, buttons, lens effects.",
